// Prefetch File Deleted | T1070.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_delete/file_delete_win_delete_prefetch.yml
(TargetFilename:*\:\\Windows\\Prefetch\\* AND TargetFilename:*.pf) AND (NOT (Image:*\:\\windows\\system32\\svchost.exe AND (User:(*AUTHORI* OR *AUTORI*))))

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
